    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.3.320.

The template manifest grows from 522 to 528 entries, adding the Bytedance
VCube video enhance, Meshy7 image/text to model and Wan 3.0 i2v/r2v/t2v API
templates. loader.py and __init__.py are byte-identical to 0.3.315.

PLEASE STAGE TOGETHER with the rest of this release train, submitted as
separate requests:
  sr#1373544  python-comfyui-workflow-templates-json           0.1.55
  sr#1373547  python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-assets-01 0.1.33
  plus python-comfyui-workflow-templates 0.11.46 (request filed right after
  this one)

The set is only consistent together: the six templates this manifest adds
name assets that exist only in -json 0.1.55 and -media-assets-01 0.1.33, and
iter_assets() raises FileNotFoundError on the first missing asset. The
0.11.44 meta package additionally pins &quot;-core = 0.3.315&quot; exactly, so it goes
unresolvable if this lands alone; its request relaxes those pins to floors.

Note this package tracks the PyPI distribution
comfyui_workflow_templates_core, whose version lineage is separate from the
comfyui_workflow_templates meta package.

(Supersedes sr#1373545, which I revoked because it was submitted alone.)
</comment>
